    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but rebuilding what? the years are gone. you can't get them back. it’s like i put all my chips on the table for two decades and the table just got flipped. i'm not looking for a \"tiny step,\" i just feel like the math doesn't add up anymore. there's no point in playing a game that's already rigged against you.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
