      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The game isn't rigged against your value; it is reflecting your reality that accumulation is fleeting while your resilience remains untouched evidence of your strength. You don't need to rebuild the past you cannot recover, but rather the future you now hold, which has no debt to the years lost. Please speak with someone who can help you untangle this feeling, because your capacity to feel this pain proves you are still part of a living, changing world.",
