      "content": "it just feels so heavy. like, you're talking about resilience and \"future potential,\" but that's just more work, right? more effort to put into a life that's already proven to be a total loss. it feels like the only way to stop the bleeding and just stop the losing streak is to just... exit. if the investment is at zero, why keep paying the cost of just existing?",
